 "steps": [
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Bring a large pot of water to a boil. Dip the spinach in for <b>30 seconds</b>, lift it out, rinse in cold water and squeeze dry. Season with a pinch of salt and <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"1\" data-s=\"0\">1 tsp</span> of the sesame oil. Keep the water boiling for the noodles.</li><li>Cut the carrot into thin matchsticks, the onion lengthwise, the mushrooms into strips and the spring onions into <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"cm\" data-a=\"5\" data-s=\"0\">5 cm</span> lengths. Mix the sauce.</li></ul>",
