  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Beat the eggs with a pinch of salt. Heat the steel pan on <b>medium-low</b>, wipe it with a little oil and pour in the egg, tilting to make a thin sheet. Cook <b>1–2 minutes</b> until set, without browning, then turn it over for a few seconds.</li><li>Roll the sheet up and slice it into thin strips.</li></ul>",
