  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Raise the heat to <b>medium-high</b>. Cook in turn, each with a little oil and a pinch of salt, and tip each onto a big plate: carrot <b>1 minute</b>, onion and spring onion <b>1 minute</b>, mushrooms <b>2 minutes</b>.</li><li>If using beef, stir-fry the strips last for <b>2 minutes</b> with <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"1\" data-s=\"0\">1 tbsp</span> of the sauce.</li></ul>",
