  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Boil the noodles for <b>6–7 minutes</b>, until soft and chewy. Drain and rinse briefly. Cut through them twice with scissors so they're easier to eat.</li><li>Put them in the hot pan with the rest of the sauce and toss on <b>medium</b> for <b>2 minutes</b>, until they absorb it and turn glossy brown.</li></ul>",
